==== Opening the case ====
**Note:** This will void your warranty!

Instructions found on [[https://boxmatrix.info/wiki/FRITZ!Box_WLAN_3370#Disassembly|BoxMatrix]]

  * Remove the 2 rubber stands close to the wallmount holes, they hide 2 of the screws
  * Open the 4 Torx 8 screws
  * Lift the casing top carefully, front hook easily breaks

//Main PCB//\\
{{ :media:avm:fritzbox_3370:fritzbox.3370_hynix.hy27uf081g2m.nand.chip_pcb.jpg?linkonly |AVM FRITZ!Box WLAN 3370 with Hynix HY27UF081G2M NAND chip}}
