**How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:**\\

Seen from the rear of the device, the most left of the 4 holes is square cut while the others are round.

^  Pin ^   1 [ ]  ^  2   ^  3   ^   4   ^
|  Function |  VCC   |  RX   |  TX   |  GND   |


